// A branch on untrusted input. riinac used to accept it; the Coq core's T_If
// requires a plain Benar, not a tainted one. Rejected since 2026-10-23 (owner
// ruling): sanitize input before branching on it.
fungsi semak(x: Tercemar<Benar, UserInput>) -> Nombor kesan Bersih {
    kalau x { 1 } lain { 2 }
}
fungsi utama() -> () kesan Bersih {
    ()
}
